    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD &amp; DEV ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/b4c1828214ba54ddc0e007c4c7daed6e.avif?t=1755500303\" width=700 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/c42de533774df9e801a76dff2ef2fde5.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1080 height=1920 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Our Official <strong>Discord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can access Discord link from the panel on the right.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=647 height=145 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1755500303\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Toy Smash Kaboom!</i> is an indie game that blends <strong>Inventory Management</strong>, <strong>Physical Collisions</strong>, and <strong>Auto-Battler strategy</strong>.<br>Enter a chaotic toy world where you\u2019re the commander - manage your investory, evolve your toys, and set traps to build your ultimate <strong>Kaboom Legion</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combos and unleash devastating ground attacks, air strikes, and magical powers to dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/e2eb640e00e487ad57e0f0f02f7d81a2.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/e2eb640e00e487ad57e0f0f02f7d81a2.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/b14122f6f084c883932f5c21012c01f2.avif?t=1755500303\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every toy comes with unique mechanics and can trigger powerful synergies through smart pairing and combining, opening up endless tactical possibilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arrange, Combine, and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning isn\u2019t just about picking the right toys\u2014it\u2019s about where and how you arrange them! Every slot is a strategic decision. Plan your layout, combine rare units, and arrange them wisely to unlock your build\u2019s full potential!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/686661e6bf895a4d8ee3077cbe3a068a.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/686661e6bf895a4d8ee3077cbe3a068a.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own tactical system from over 300 strategic toys!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ summons to clash in tabletop battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ traps to outsmart your opponents and shift momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ magic and weapons to power up your strategy and unleash devastating combos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a93809bc279eeb85b63e164a99fe5991.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a93809bc279eeb85b63e164a99fe5991.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/e7b6b7516112bfc1603d24f16c14def2.avif?t=1755500303\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break away from classic inventory management and auto-battlers\u2014it brings full-contact toy clashes to the tabletop, delivering a one-of-a-kind side-scrolling strategy experience bursting with playful chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collisions &amp; Knockback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon toys into head-to-head battles where it\u2019s not just about stats\u2014brave charges and knockback strikes can send enemies flying, turning the tide in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/0461f12ee9d083923328ad0f10420fec.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/0461f12ee9d083923328ad0f10420fec.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps across the table to break enemy momentum and open up opportunities to strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/acca0ce110ceaaa7ec489d06b30daeca.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/acca0ce110ceaaa7ec489d06b30daeca.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/e92ee2dcc72812278c01b658aaeb3def.avif?t=1755500303\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in asynchronous PvP where your legion clashes with global builds in tactical showdowns. Analyze, adapt, and optimize your strategy in mirror matches and rise through the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Toy Captain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings a unique toy arsenal and distinct battle mechanics, shaping your strategy and playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doll Chef: A kitchen defense expert who controls space and fortifies positions, perfect for defensive-minded players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Hamster: Commander of Hamster Legion that leads a swarm of tiny units to overwhelm enemies with relentless numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppet Musician: A rhythm master who speeds up allies and disrupts foes, setting the tempo of every battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New heroes are on the way, and you\u2019ll get to uncover the stories behind your toys and enjoy even more DIY fun \u2014 all coming in the full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ab3daf94919f8841d7338d471e25c055.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ab3daf94919f8841d7338d471e25c055.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1755500303\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Our Official <strong>Discord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can access Discord link from the panel on the right.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=647 height=145 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1755500303\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Toy Smash Kaboom!</i> is an indie game that blends <strong>Inventory Management</strong>, <strong>Physical Collisions</strong>, and <strong>Auto-Battler strategy</strong>.<br>Enter a chaotic toy world where you\u2019re the commander - manage your investory, evolve your toys, and set traps to build your ultimate <strong>Kaboom Legion</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combos and unleash devastating ground attacks, air strikes, and magical powers to dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/e2eb640e00e487ad57e0f0f02f7d81a2.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/e2eb640e00e487ad57e0f0f02f7d81a2.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> \u0