ster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/acca0ce110ceaaa7ec489d06b30daeca.webm?t=1755500303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/e92ee2dcc72812278c01b658aaeb3def.avif?t=1755500303\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in asynchronous PvP where your legion clashes with global builds in tactical showdowns. Analyze, adapt, and optimize your strategy in mirror matches and rise through the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Toy Captain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings a unique toy arsenal and distinct battle mechanics, shaping your strategy and playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doll Chef: A kitchen defense expert who controls space and fortifies positions, perfect for defensive-minded players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Hamster: Commander of Hamster Legion that leads a swarm of tiny units to overwhelm enemies with relentless numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppet Musician: A rhythm master who speeds up allies and disrupts foes, setting the tempo of every battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New heroes are on the way, and you\u2019ll get to uncover the stories behind your toys and enjoy even more DIY fun \u2014 all coming in the full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ab3daf94919f8841d7338d471e25c055.poster.avif?t=1755500303\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ab3daf94919f8841d7338d471